{"3097220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gray Planet", "steam_appid": 3097220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several centuries later, terraforming technology has been developed, and humanity is pioneering and living on numerous planets. You are a mercenary and traveler who roams various planets, but you have crash-landed on a planet overrun by nanomachines. Explore to discover what happened on this planet and gather resources along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore various regions. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the diverse regions of this planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/401180dffd51600e5121b64b91d462fb.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/401180dffd51600e5121b64b91d462fb.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/401180dffd51600e5121b64b91d462fb.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >various monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This planet harbors various kinds of threats.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Infector  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are creature infected by nanomachines, and they will rush at you in an attempt to infect you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6c7ecb5c43d4f4bd050c1f2b482be812.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6c7ecb5c43d4f4bd050c1f2b482be812.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6c7ecb5c43d4f4bd050c1f2b482be812.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Robot  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were workers helping people, but after being corrupted by nanomachines, they started attacking humans.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/8a2d215734b66252c0c02e20be695d41.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/8a2d215734b66252c0c02e20be695d41.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/8a2d215734b66252c0c02e20be695d41.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Nanomorph  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are new lifeforms created by clusters of nanomachines, exhibiting various unique behaviors such as splitting and camouflage.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/e40d487d18ab5f1f70767ca1dc8a49d7.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/e40d487d18ab5f1f70767ca1dc8a49d7.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/e40d487d18ab5f1f70767ca1dc8a49d7.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources and Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain resources by defeating enemies or by dismantling minerals and various debris.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/d8a4790f3659870fa74c19f329e94e29.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/d8a4790f3659870fa74c19f329e94e29.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/d8a4790f3659870fa74c19f329e94e29.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft various equipment using the resources you have obtained</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft various equipment and use them to defeat enemies or explore the world.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/b4f0a88d90aec0ad62d1d4563f3c9b28.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/b4f0a88d90aec0ad62d1d4563f3c9b28.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/b4f0a88d90aec0ad62d1d4563f3c9b28.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Modify guns and equipment to create your own custom gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6fe7860d9015b719ccd29384fc79c43e.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6fe7860d9015b719ccd29384fc79c43e.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6fe7860d9015b719ccd29384fc79c43e.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base to store resources, craft equipment and vehicles, and create a place to rest.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/5e4e459465be95f2b9ac4442ebbdb505.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/5e4e459465be95f2b9ac4442ebbdb505.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/5e4e459465be95f2b9ac4442ebbdb505.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several centuries later, terraforming technology has been developed, and humanity is pioneering and living on numerous planets. You are a mercenary and traveler who roams various planets, but you have crash-landed on a planet overrun by nanomachines. Explore to discover what happened on this planet and gather resources along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore various regions. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the diverse regions of this planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/401180dffd51600e5121b64b91d462fb.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/401180dffd51600e5121b64b91d462fb.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/401180dffd51600e5121b64b91d462fb.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >various monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This planet harbors various kinds of threats.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Infector  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are creature infected by nanomachines, and they will rush at you in an attempt to infect you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6c7ecb5c43d4f4bd050c1f2b482be812.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6c7ecb5c43d4f4bd050c1f2b482be812.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6c7ecb5c43d4f4bd050c1f2b482be812.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Robot  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were workers helping people, but after being corrupted by nanomachines, they started attacking humans.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/8a2d215734b66252c0c02e20be695d41.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/8a2d215734b66252c0c02e20be695d41.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/8a2d215734b66252c0c02e20be695d41.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Nanomorph  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are new lifeforms created by clusters of nanomachines, exhibiting various unique behaviors such as splitting and camouflage.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/e40d487d18ab5f1f70767ca1dc8a49d7.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/e40d487d18ab5f1f70767ca1dc8a49d7.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/e40d487d18ab5f1f70767ca1dc8a49d7.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources and Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain resources by defeating enemies or by dismantling minerals and various debris.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/d8a4790f3659870fa74c19f329e94e29.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/d8a4790f3659870fa74c19f329e94e29.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/d8a4790f3659870fa74c19f329e94e29.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft various equipment using the resources you have obtained</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft various equipment and use them to defeat enemies or explore the world.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/b4f0a88d90aec0ad62d1d4563f3c9b28.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/b4f0a88d90aec0ad62d1d4563f3c9b28.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/b4f0a88d90aec0ad62d1d4563f3c9b28.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Modify guns and equipment to create your own custom gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6fe7860d9015b719ccd29384fc79c43e.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6fe7860d9015b719ccd29384fc79c43e.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/6fe7860d9015b719ccd29384fc79c43e.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base to store resources, craft equipment and vehicles, and create a place to rest.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/5e4e459465be95f2b9ac4442ebbdb505.poster.avif?t=1779323432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/5e4e459465be95f2b9ac4442ebbdb505.webm?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/5e4e459465be95f2b9ac4442ebbdb505.mp4?t=1779323432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore a open world set in a post-apocalyptic background, gather resources to craft various equipment and build your base. Defeat different types of monsters while investigating what happened on this planet.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/ae3cbef5b31d1242f091fbd95c7f141ff530bf40/header.jpg?t=1779323432", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/a11a5257719f125bd8b84ea504433a92249a0048/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779323432", "capsule_imagev5": "https:/